# Kaja, Nazar King

> Kaja is no longer a kidnapper. The 2.1.95 rework replaced his single-target suppress with an area restraint cage, turned his dash into terrain-ignoring flight, and put Paralysis on every skill. He is the roam who decides where the teamfight happens, not the one who deletes a single carry.

