## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Cage Engage Roam (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Athena's Shield
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic poke where Athena's Shield is consumed before the real engage.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the main physical threat is a basic-attack marksman rather than a skill-burst fighter.; Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against low-CC physical drafts where stacked physical defense matters more than control reduction.
- Total cost: 11200 gold

Default ranked setup after the 2.1.95 rework. Conceal and Flicker buy the approach angle, Dominance Ice turns the crowd caught in Divine Binding into hybrid defense, and Fleeting Time cycles the 60s cage back on the kills and assists the cage itself creates.

### Encourage Frontline Roam (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Radiant Armor, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Radiant Armor
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when chain crowd control or magic poke is the main reason Kaja cannot reach ult range.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-shot magic burst from heroes who front-load their damage into one combo.; Blade Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use when a fed marksman is forced to hit Kaja during peel fights and regen is too slow to matter.
- Total cost: 11400 gold

Durability-first roam setup for games where Kaja must stand in front with the tank line instead of only hunting flank angles.

### Soaring Thunderbolt Roam (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic poke that grinds Kaja down before he ever reaches cage range.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use when Kaja survives the fights but cannot rotate again without backing, and the extra HP feeds Thunderbolt harder than a revive would.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the main physical threat is a basic-attack marksman rather than a skill-burst fighter.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Damage-through-defense variant. Thunderbolt scales off total hybrid defense and hits everyone around the target, which is exactly what the Soaring state's area basic attacks deliver, so every defensive item in this list is also a damage item. Take it when the draft already has a main tank and Kaja is free to fly at the clump.

All builds for this hero: https://mlbbhub.com/builds/kaja.

